config BEAU_RPMSG_PEER
	tristate "BEAU VM0 VM3 full-duplex RPMsg peer"
	depends on RPMSG
	help
	  Bind the dedicated beau-rpmsg-peer service announced by the BEAU VM0
	  Zephyr guest. The peer publishes READY and acknowledges validated VM0
	  requests without consuming the existing rpmsg-raw character endpoint.
